{"id": "money-files-nobody-votes-against", "title": "The Board says yes: 96% of money files pass with no one voting no", "seconds": 130.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "tempo": 1.107, "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "c6353b607bff3257", "words": 449, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "Big City contracts, leases and grants end at the Board of Supervisors, with a roll call.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.14, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "pins": [{"place": "cityhall", "name": "Board of Supervisors", "sub": "the final roll call"}], "zoomOn": "board", "scale": 1.9, "kicker": "San Francisco"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.41, 1.06, 1.42, 1.53, 1.96, 2.13, 2.23, 2.32, 2.52, 2.6, 3.25, 3.41, 3.48, 3.68]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "oneLine"], "text": "Since 2015, the Board cast a final vote on 3,483 of them.", "t0": 4.26, "t1": 9.26, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "3,483 final votes", "sub": "contracts, leases, grants, settlements and appropriations, 2015 to 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.47, 1.28, 1.41, 1.64, 1.94, 2.01, 2.31, 2.56, 2.71, 2.95, 3.38, 3.6, 3.83, 4.31, 4.41]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "oneLine"], "text": "How many passed without a single no?", "t0": 9.26, "t1": 11.24, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "3,483 final votes", "sub": "contracts, leases, grants, settlements and appropriations, 2015 to 2026"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.2, 0.38, 0.62, 0.85, 0.91, 1.2]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "share", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "oneLine"], "text": "96.4 percent.", "t0": 11.24, "t1": 12.6, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "share", "pct": 96.4, "label": "3,359 of 3,483 passed with no one voting no"}, "emph": ["96.4 percent"], "wt": [0.04, 0.51, 0.72, 0.91]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 13.12, "t1": 14.59, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.26, 0.34, 0.85, 1.01, 1.07]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "slam", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "story[6]"], "text": "Only 3 were voted down. So the final vote is rarely where a contract gets tested.", "t0": 14.71, "t1": 18.66, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "slam", "words": ["3", "voted", "down"], "sub": "of 3,483 money files with a final vote"}, "emph": ["3"], "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.51, 0.66, 0.94, 1.58, 1.75, 1.86, 2.14, 2.4, 2.54, 2.79, 2.94, 3.0, 3.35, 3.53]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "story[5]"], "text": "First, votes come in bunches:", "t0": 18.88, "t1": 20.83, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "Same day, same line-up", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "groups of 5 or more money files"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.61, 0.9, 1.04, 1.13]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "story[5]"], "text": "2,983 in groups of 5 or more files, same day, identical line-up.", "t0": 20.83, "t1": 26.25, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "Same day, same line-up", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "groups of 5 or more money files"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.25, 0.61, 0.78, 1.13, 1.77, 1.93, 2.18, 2.28, 2.56, 2.65, 2.85, 3.7, 4.02, 4.56, 4.99]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "The largest: 44 files, on December 8, 2015.", "t0": 26.37, "t1": 29.73, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "44", "label": "files on 8 December 2015, 11 to 0", "sub": "$886.2 million named"}, "emph": ["The"], "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.86, 1.36, 1.77, 1.9, 2.27, 2.61, 2.93]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "notEstablished[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "One consent vote, or 44 separate ones? The 2015 minutes: 5 on one vote, 39 alone.", "t0": 30.25, "t1": 35.95, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "each with its own printed vote of 11 to 0"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.61, 0.92, 1.11, 1.56, 1.88, 2.61, 2.76, 3.03, 3.39, 3.89, 4.18, 4.3, 4.47, 4.88, 5.34]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[4]"], "text": "Later minutes: 30 of 33 files in 2020 were called together, each with the same printed vote.", "t0": 36.07, "t1": 41.21, "shot": "b7b", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "called together"}, "emph": ["called together"], "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.91, 1.25, 1.33, 1.77, 2.13, 2.23, 2.53, 3.17, 3.33, 3.51, 4.01, 4.22, 4.35, 4.45, 4.66, 4.94]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "story[3]"], "text": "Dissent shows up when a committee won’t recommend a file: a no vote 24.2 percent of the time.", "t0": 41.43, "t1": 46.48, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["sent on with no recommendation", "24.2% drew a no"], "b": ["all other money files", "3.2%"]}, "emph": ["24.2 percent"], "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.69, 0.82, 0.97, 1.04, 1.35, 1.53, 1.84, 1.9, 2.77, 2.89, 3.07, 3.32, 3.82, 4.06, 4.31, 4.59, 4.66, 4.75]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "story[3]"], "text": "All others, 3.2.", "t0": 46.6, "t1": 47.96, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["sent on with no recommendation", "24.2% drew a no"], "b": ["all other money files", "3.2%"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.62, 0.85, 1.06]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "story[6]"], "text": "One file got a do not pass: a lease with The Lighthouse Building LLC. It lost 0 to 11.", "t0": 48.08, "t1": 52.72, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "The Lighthouse Building LLC", "kicker": "“do not pass”", "sub": "office lease, voted down 0 to 11, 2023"}, "emph": ["0 to 11"], "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.52, 0.65, 0.7, 0.83, 0.99, 1.59, 1.7, 1.95, 2.1, 2.19, 2.57, 2.86, 3.64, 3.8, 3.98, 4.2, 4.29]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "story[7]"], "text": "Now the members. 32 passed files named a group the member had declared: a gift, income or investment.", "t0": 52.94, "t1": 58.48, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "A declared source, then a vote", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "Form 700 gifts, income and investments"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.27, 1.27, 1.69, 1.94, 2.28, 2.45, 2.51, 2.76, 2.87, 3.12, 3.22, 3.96, 4.08, 4.64, 4.98, 5.08]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "story[7]"], "text": "How often did the member vote yes?", "t0": 58.6, "t1": 60.42, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "A declared source, then a vote", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "Form 700 gifts, income and investments"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.43, 0.55, 0.64, 0.92, 1.13]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "31 of 32.", "t0": 60.42, "t1": 61.42, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "31", "label": "yes votes of 32; no recusal notice on any"}, "emph": ["31"], "wt": [0.04, 0.45, 0.52]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why"], "text": "The largest: File 260444,", "t0": 61.94, "t1": 65.03, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Children’s Council of San Francisco", "sub": "File 260444, $234.9 million"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Alan Wong", "sub": "declared income, Over $100,000"}, {"art": "gavel", "name": "Final roll call", "sub": "11 to 0, 2026-07-21"}], "kicker": "The largest"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.95, 1.26, 1.47, 1.7, 2.02, 2.27, 2.53]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why"], "text": "for Children’s Council of San Francisco, 234.9 million dollars.", "t0": 65.03, "t1": 69.18, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Children’s Council of San Francisco", "sub": "File 260444, $234.9 million"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Alan Wong", "sub": "declared income, Over $100,000"}, {"art": "gavel", "name": "Final roll call", "sub": "11 to 0, 2026-07-21"}], "kicker": "The largest"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.21, 0.54, 0.86, 0.93, 1.08, 1.95, 2.13, 2.39, 2.89, 3.16, 3.39, 3.69]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why"], "text": "Alan Wong voted yes, and his 2025 statement lists income there of over 100,000 dollars.", "t0": 69.3, "t1": 74.27, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Children’s Council of San Francisco", "sub": "File 260444, $234.9 million"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Alan Wong", "sub": "declared income, Over $100,000"}, {"art": "gavel", "name": "Final roll call", "sub": "11 to 0, 2026-07-21"}], "kicker": "The largest"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.56, 0.82, 1.29, 1.45, 1.56, 1.82, 2.21, 2.57, 2.83, 3.13, 3.42, 3.57, 3.83, 4.0, 4.21, 4.49]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why"], "text": "But his statement covers a year that began before his first vote. So the pay may be from a job before he took the seat.", "t0": 74.39, "t1": 79.23, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Children’s Council of San Francisco", "sub": "File 260444, $234.9 million"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Alan Wong", "sub": "declared income, Over $100,000"}, {"art": "gavel", "name": "Final roll call", "sub": "11 to 0, 2026-07-21"}], "kicker": "The largest"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.2, 0.56, 0.82, 0.88, 1.05, 1.16, 1.45, 1.68, 1.78, 2.02, 2.83, 2.99, 3.07, 3.28, 3.44, 3.59, 3.75, 3.82, 4.08, 4.32, 4.39, 4.55, 4.65]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "And Bay Area Community Resources paid Shamann Walton’s travel,", "t0": 79.35, "t1": 82.64, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Bay Area Community Resources", "sub": "travel payment to Shamann Walton, 2023-10-09", "chip": "$1,679"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.38, 0.68, 1.07, 1.61, 1.84, 2.2, 2.59]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "worth 1,679 dollars, before File 240739 named it.", "t0": 82.64, "t1": 87.65, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Bay Area Community Resources", "sub": "travel payment to Shamann Walton, 2023-10-09", "chip": "$1,679"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.33, 0.54, 0.94, 1.14, 1.37, 1.86, 2.5, 2.81, 3.08, 3.4, 3.67, 3.93, 4.18, 4.39, 4.65, 4.91]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "Only the Ethics Commission can rule on recusal.", "t0": 87.77, "t1": 89.9, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Bay Area Community Resources", "sub": "travel payment to Shamann Walton, 2023-10-09", "chip": "$1,679"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.38, 0.7, 1.14, 1.3, 1.5, 1.59]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["story[8]", "established[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "Do votes follow donations? No more than chance.", "t0": 90.02, "t1": 92.24, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Ethics Commission penalties naming roster officials", "rows": [["22 resolved cases", "$207,033"], ["the largest, 2024-11-08", "$108,180"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.35, 0.56, 1.42, 1.55, 1.68, 1.81]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["story[8]", "established[1]"], "text": "Separately, the Ethics Commission has fined 13 of 36 officials or their committees, mostly over campaign finance.", "t0": 92.36, "t1": 97.73, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Ethics Commission penalties naming roster officials", "rows": [["22 resolved cases", "$207,033"], ["the largest, 2024-11-08", "$108,180"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 0.59, 0.87, 1.21, 1.31, 1.54, 1.96, 2.06, 2.53, 2.94, 3.05, 3.2, 3.96, 4.3, 4.48, 4.83]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "timeline[2]"], "text": "Last, a hole in the record. For 332 roll calls, the Clerk’s vote page names no member at all.", "t0": 97.95, "t1": 102.98, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "s1", "kicker": "The Clerk’s vote page", "text": "announces a vote and names no member", "mark": "names no member"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.47, 0.63, 0.7, 0.81, 1.52, 1.69, 1.9, 2.14, 2.56, 2.76, 3.19, 3.32, 3.58, 3.77, 4.07, 4.32, 4.46, 4.7, 4.78]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "timeline[2]"], "text": "Most date from April to July 2016.", "t0": 103.1, "t1": 105.06, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "s1", "kicker": "The Clerk’s vote page", "text": "announces a vote and names no member", "mark": "names no member"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.42, 0.57, 0.86, 0.95, 1.24, 1.46]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[4].what", "suspicious[4].why"], "text": "The published minutes filled in 315. 17 are still blank.", "t0": 105.18, "t1": 108.52, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["read from the published minutes", "315"], "b": ["still without member votes", "17"]}, "emph": ["17"], "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.43, 0.7, 0.92, 1.0, 1.19, 1.4, 2.29, 2.71, 2.81, 2.98]}, {"scene": "record", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[5]", "established[6]"], "text": "Most passed without dissent, and financial disclosures were available for eight of the eleven members.", "t0": 108.74, "t1": 112.85, "shot": "record-5,6-197 recorded final votes in 2014", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "rc14web", "text": "197 recorded final votes in 2014", "mark": "197 recorded final votes in 2014", "kicker": "Clerk of the Board of Supervisors, City and County of San Francisco"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.49, 0.73, 1.19, 1.37, 1.75, 2.24, 2.37, 2.79, 2.95, 3.18, 3.27, 3.37, 3.65]}, {"scene": "record", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[7]"], "text": "Files outside the money list passed without dissent at a similar rate.", "t0": 112.97, "t1": 115.71, "shot": "record-7-95.3%", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "v25", "text": "95.3%", "mark": "95.3%", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.62, 0.71, 0.92, 1.14, 1.43, 1.68, 2.06, 2.17, 2.23, 2.53]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[4]"], "text": "Nothing shows any vote was cast for a reason other than the member’s own judgment.", "t0": 115.93, "t1": 119.07, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any vote was cast for a reason other than the member’s own judgment", "What scrutiny a file got before the vote"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.59, 0.75, 0.96, 1.09, 1.35, 1.48, 1.55, 1.88, 2.12, 2.26, 2.35, 2.63, 2.77]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[3]", "next[0]"], "text": "What would settle it? Minutes for the biggest same-day lists. And the Clerk’s own record of the blank roll calls.", "t0": 119.19, "t1": 124.56, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "Minutes for the largest same-day lists: one consent roll call, or separate votes?"}, {"who": "", "what": "The Clerk’s own record of the blank roll calls"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.35, 0.63, 1.13, 1.48, 1.6, 1.69, 1.97, 2.38, 3.11, 3.33, 3.43, 3.78, 4.0, 4.31, 4.4, 4.49, 4.72, 4.93]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Nothing here is a finding against any member or organization.", "t0": 124.68, "t1": 127.49, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.59, 0.69, 0.76, 1.08, 1.41, 1.64, 1.92, 2.03]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 127.61, "t1": 129.39, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.32, 0.4, 0.47, 0.96, 1.14, 1.22]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "lead1": "Lead 1 · one line-up", "lead2": "Lead 2 · where dissent shows", "lead3": "Lead 3 · declared sources", "lead4": "Lead 4 · names missing", "close": "Where it stands", "rec